>च</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">विस्तरतो</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">वर्णिता</span> ।</span></div><div class=\"mfn-n mfn-unl\" data-mfnid=\"mfn-Kena-3.1-52-2\"><span class=\"mfn-ka\" title=\"Mahesh Research Institute edition (S. Subrahmanya Shastri): page · note\">MRI <span class=\"mfn-kn\">52·2</span></span> <span class=\"mfn-ul\" title=\"not linked yet — the word this note explains has not been identified in our text; shown in the edition’s order after the nearest linked note of this verse (no mark in the text)\">○</span> <span class=\"mfn-x\"><span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">यद्विज्ञातं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">यत् विज्ञातम्</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तदेवास्ति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तत् एव अस्ति</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">विपर्यये</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">नास्ति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">न अस्ति</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">अतः</span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अविज्ञातत्वान्नास्ति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">अविज्ञातत्वात् न अस्ति</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\"><span class=\"bhsj\">ब्रह्मेति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">ब्रह्म इति</span></span> <span class=\"w mfn-w\" data-g=\"mrifn\">योजनीयम्</span> ।</span></div></details></div>"],"gt":{"अत्राग्नेः":["अत्र · अव्यय + अग्नि · षष्ठी·एक·पुं","here; of Agni","अत्र + अग्नेः","",[["अग्नि|पुं",2]]],"वायोः":["वायु · षष्ठी·एक·पुं","of Vāyu","","",[["वायु|पुं"]]],"इन्द्रस्य":["इन्द्र · षष्ठी·एक·पुं","of Indra","","",[["इन्द्र|पुं"]]],"च":["च · अव्यय (समुच्चयार्थक)","and, also",""],"स्वयमवगन्तुमशक्यं":["स्वयम् · अव्यय + अव-√गम् + तुमुन् · अव्यय + अ-शक्य (नञ्-तत्पुरुष) · प्रथमा·एक·नपुं","impossible to understand by oneself","","",[["अशक्य|न",2]]],"ब्रह्म":["ब्रह्मन् · प्रथमा·एक·नपुं","Brahman, the Absolute","","",[["ब्रह्मन्|न"]]],"देव्या":["देवी · 